Usage: opentide generate docs objectives [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --output <OUTPUT>
          Write the pages here instead of the configured docs folder

      --flavor <FLAVOR>
          Markdown flavour: github, gitlab, azure_devops or generic

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate docs objectives

